OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FExtensively dry with warm sunny
OL,6,Fspells across the region. Just a very
OL,7,Fsmall chance of a light shower this
OL,8,Fafternoon. Winds gradually easing
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon into the evening
OL,10,Fto become light and variable.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSkies will clear overnight
OL,13,Fwith light winds, allowing
OL,14,Ftemperatures to fall and the chance of
OL,15,Fmist or of patches forming around dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FMorning mist and fog patches
OL,18,Fwill quickly clear to give a bright
OL,19,Fmorning before turning cloudy in the
OL,20,Fafternoon with a band of rain arriving
OL,21,Ffrom the west overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
