OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fperiods with isolated showers on
OL,7,FSaturday, lighter winds. Often cloudy
OL,8,FSunday but dry. A foggy start on
OL,9,FMonday, then cloudy. Temperatures near
OL,10,For slightly above average.
